  (text "EastRising ER-TFT035IPS-6 (ILI9488, 4-wire SPI). Its 50-pin FPC folds under the panel into J3 (ZIF)."
    (at 160.02 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "a92c992f-655c-425a-8386-9cb9324cc692"))

  (text "J3 pin j is panel pin 51 - j. Unused bus pins as the datasheet says: DB0-17 and RGB low, RD and IM2-0 high."
    (at 162.56 19 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "f1231b9a-8759-41da-a721-a1d6877f6f2b"))

  (text "Backlight: LED_A on VSYS; a current sink per cathode pin (U6 half, Q5/Q6, 2.2 ohm R52/R53). GPIO44 PWM,"
    (at 161.29 23 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "5e1486fa-6f22-41fc-b9ef-6e249c372b69"))

